{{Term/Store|Lizard|Lizards|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Hyrule Compendium"/><ref name="TotK Hyrule Compendium"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Main|Fireproof Lizard, Hearty Lizard, Hightail Lizard}}
Lizards are a type of [[Creature]] common throughout [[Hyrule]]. They typically rest on the sides of [[Tree]]s, but they can also be found by lifting [[Rock]]s and cutting [[Grass]]. When [[Link]] approaches a Lizard, it will run away and eventually disappear. This can be avoided by stunning it with an [[Arrow]] or [[Remote Bomb]]. Link can also use [[Stealth]] to approach the Lizard without it noticing, or he can catch up to it after it begins to flee.

Three types of Lizards exist in Hyrule. The first is the [[Hightail Lizard]], which is most common on the [[Great Plateau]], in [[East Necluda]], and in [[West Necluda]]. It can be [[Cooking|Cooked]] with [[Monster Part]]s to create a [[Hasty Elixir]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The second is the [[Hearty Lizard]], found in the [[Gerudo Desert]] and along the [[Necluda Sea]]. Hearty Lizards are considered to be rare, but they can be used as an ingredient to make a [[Hearty Elixir]].<ref name="BotW Inventory 2"/> The final Lizard is the Fireproof Lizard, which inhabits the [[Eldin Canyon]] and [[Death Mountain]]. Due to the heat-resistant properties of its scales, it can be used to create a [[Fireproof Elixir]].<ref name="BotW Inventory 3"/>

